            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9464, Chicago Solid Brass Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nJust because this pull is simple in design, doesn't mean that it is boring. Sometimes classic design offers the most elegant style--granting a timelessness to any home with ease. Made of solid brass, the Chicago Cabinet Pull emulates the quality that Omnia products are known for. The Chicago Solid Brass Cabinet Pull is offered in 5 beautiful finishes, making it easy to find just the right color for your decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/3-8-inch-diameter-chicago-stainless-steel-cabinet-pull-omnia-9464-us32d\"><b>Stainless Steel Chicago Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Midwest Chicago Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9464/100</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9464/125</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
